to run:

- have homebrew and clang installed
- run "brew install websocketpp"
- run "g++ -std=c++17 -I/opt/homebrew/opt/websocketpp/include \    -I/opt/homebrew/opt/boost/include -I/opt/homebrew/opt/openssl@3/include \
    -L/opt/homebrew/opt/boost/lib -L/opt/homebrew/opt/openssl@3/lib \
    -o eth_mempool_monitor eth_mempool_monitor.cpp \
    -lboost_system -lssl -lcrypto" or something similar.

-run  ./eth_mempool_monitor <WEBSOCKET LINK>

you should see pending ethereum transactions print out 



Or using Makefile

Compile:
    make
Run (replace <WEBSOCKET LINK> with your actual link):
    make run WS_LINK=wss://<WEBSOCKET LINK>
Clean:
    make clean

